Figure 11.1: Our demo user space app showing the CPU affinity mask of the calling process
Here, we have run the app with no parameters. In this mode, it queries the CPU affinity mask of
itself (meaning, of the userspc_cpuaffinity calling process). We print out the bits of the bitmask:
as you can clearly see in the preceding screenshot (Figure 11.1), it’s binary 1111 1111 1111 (which
